## Article

```catala
declaration scope A:
    input x content integer
    output b condition

scope A:
    rule b under condition x=0 consequence fulfilled
```

```catala-test-cli
$ catala DCalc -s A
let scope A (A_in: A_in): A =
  let get x : integer = A_in.x_in in
  let set b : bool =
    error_empty
      ⟨ ⟨ ⟨x = 0 ⊢ ⟨true⟩⟩ | false ⊢ ∅ ⟩
      | true ⊢ ⟨ ⟨true ⊢ ⟨false⟩⟩ | false ⊢ ∅ ⟩ ⟩
  in
  return { A b = b; }
```

```catala-test-cli
$ catala Concolic --conc-optim=incremental -s A
┌─[RESULT]─ Concolic execution ─
│ Executed 2 tests:
│     Inputs │ Outputs
│ ────── Test #1 ────────
│ x_in = 0   │ b = true
│ ────── Test #2 ────────
│ x_in = 2   │ b = false
└─
```

